source('nrcs-bio','河岸土壤生物工程技術補編~Streambank Soil Bioengineering technical supplement','USDA Natural Resources Conservation Service','https://directives.nrcs.usda.gov/sites/default/files2/1712931151/7366.pdf','讀二〇〇七年版目錄、歷史與適用性段落，並抽讀護趾與植生主題；不宣稱全部案例已審核~Reads 2007 contents, history and applicability passages and selected toe/vegetation topics; not a review of every case','turn221view0;turn224view0',['NEH 654 Technical Supplement 14I issued August 2007','Lists toe, bank and floodplain treatments and Winooski River historical example'])
