source('usbr-fish-evaluation','魚類篩網水理現地評估指南~Hydraulic Field Evaluations at Fish Screening Facilities','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/hydraulics_lab/pubs/manuals/Guidelines%20for%20Fish%20Screening%20Evaluations.pdf','讀二〇〇九年封面目錄與評估概念，篩網只作與魚道的比較，不將兩種設施混稱~Reads 2009 title, contents and evaluation concepts; screening is compared with fish passage rather than conflated with it','turn226view5',['April 2009 field evaluation guide','Screen evaluations are distinct from upstream fish-ladder design'])
