source('nws-hefs','集合水文預報官方問答~Hydrologic ensemble forecast official FAQ','National Weather Service','https://www.weather.gov/marfc/HEFS-FAQ','讀集合預報、不確定性與二〇一七年試行背景，不將舊更新時程視為現行服務承諾~Reads ensemble uncertainty and the 2017 experimental history; old update schedules are not current service commitments','turn226view4;turn225search23',['MARFC experimental HEFS products began late 2017','Displayed probability ranges are not hard physical bounds'])
source('cw3e-firo','俄羅斯河預報知情操作研究~Russian River forecast informed operations research','UC San Diego Center for Western Weather and Water Extremes','https://cw3e.ucsd.edu/firo_russian_river','讀研究自二〇一四年發展與門多西諾及索諾瑪湖案例，未將教材方案當核准操作~Reads development since 2014 and Lake Mendocino/Lake Sonoma context; teaching scenarios are not approved operations','turn226view3',['FIRO development and testing with partners since 2014','Lake Mendocino and Lake Sonoma are named reservoir cases'])
project('b276','以水流荷載、活體建立與河岸監測共同設計護岸~Designing bank protection through hydraulic loads, plant establishment and monitoring','由趾部沖刷、木構浮力到根系補強與季節存活，逐一拆開生態護岸的承載機制。課程要求先辨認河道變遷與植物適生條件，再安排材料、施工窗口與後續監測，以對照組觀察功能是否形成，而不把綠色外觀當成安全證明。~Separate the load paths of toe protection, buoyant wood, root reinforcement and seasonal plant establishment. Identify channel adjustment and vegetation suitability before selecting materials, construction windows and monitoring. Use comparison sites to examine whether the intended functions actually develop instead of treating a green bank as evidence of structural performance.','美國自然資源保育署二〇〇七年河岸土壤生物工程補編，將河趾、岸坡與洪氾平原的處理方式分開討論，並收錄佛蒙特州威努斯基河背景。二〇二〇年國家層級護岸標準目錄另提醒實作須依地方文件。雷赫河一九九八年啟動的復育計畫則提供河川動態與棲地共存的尺度參照。本課不聲稱這些案例採用相同工法，所有荷載及材料數字均為獨立教材假設。~The 2007 NRCS soil bioengineering supplement distinguishes treatments at the toe, bank and floodplain and includes Winooski River context in Vermont. The 2020 national bank protection directory directs actual application to local documents. The Regge programme launched in 1998 offers a broader example of accommodating river dynamics and habitat. These references do not imply identical construction methods. All loads and material quantities in the exercises are independently chosen teaching assumptions.',['NRCS 生物工程補編出版於 2007 年，屬方法文獻年代~The NRCS bioengineering supplement was published in 2007, a methodological publication date','雷赫河復育計畫於 1998 年啟動，並非本課假設護岸開工日~The Regge programme began in 1998, not the construction date of the hypothetical bank'],[dict(year='1998',event='雷赫河計畫啟動，作為河川復育尺度參照~The Regge programme begins as a reference for river restoration scale'),dict(year='2007',event='NRCS 河岸生物工程方法補編出版~NRCS publishes its streambank soil bioengineering technical supplement')],['NRCS NEH 654 TS14I 生物工程方法補編，適用性須另查~NRCS NEH 654 TS14I bioengineering methods, with applicability checked separately','NRCS 580 國家標準目錄，實作須使用地方適用版~NRCS 580 national directory, requiring the locally applicable version for practice'],['威努斯基河岸案例~Winooski River bank reference','雷赫河復育案例~Regge River restoration reference'],dict(name='威努斯基河區域參照點~Winooski River regional reference',country='美國~United States',lat=44.48,lng=-73.19,query='Winooski River Vermont'),['nrcs-bio','nrcs-bank-standard','eea-regge'])
project('b277','由河床縱坡、能量耗散與泥砂連續性設計固床工~Designing grade control through bed slope, energy dissipation and sediment continuity','固床工會改變水面、河床及泥砂通量，並非把河床固定後便完成任務。十個單元連結落差配置、臨界水深、水躍、揚壓、顆粒起動、濾層與上下游地形反應，讓學員分辨幾何可行、結構穩定與河道長期平衡三種不同檢核。~Grade control changes water levels, bed elevations and sediment fluxes. Ten units connect drop spacing, critical depth, hydraulic jumps, uplift, grain motion, filters and channel response. Learners distinguish geometric feasibility, structural resistance and long term channel adjustment, and examine how protecting one location may transfer erosion or sedimentation to another reach.','美國自然資源保育署二〇〇七年固床技術補編同時討論水理、沖刷與河道反應，案例包括伊利諾州藍溪的一九九七與二〇〇二年縱斷面，以及曼尼托巴省明克溪的塊石構造。這些圖說年份是調查資料年代，不等同施工或完工年代。另以工程兵團泥砂手冊釐清希爾茲參數的定義，避免把任一輸砂公式的臨界值套用到所有河床。~The 2007 NRCS grade stabilization supplement considers hydraulics, scour and channel response. Its examples include Blue Creek profiles dated 1997 and 2002 and a loose rock structure at Mink Creek in Manitoba. Profile dates identify survey evidence rather than construction or completion. The Corps sediment reference provides the Shields definition and explains why critical parameters must correspond to the chosen transport formulation. The lesson uses original numerical examples rather than reproducing case design values.',['藍溪案例列出 1997 年縱斷面，代表調查年代~The Blue Creek example labels a 1997 profile, identifying a survey date','藍溪另列 2002 年縱斷面，提供地形比較資料~A 2002 Blue Creek profile supplies comparative morphological evidence'],[dict(year='1997',event='藍溪案例所列縱斷面基準調查年代~Date of the baseline Blue Creek profile shown in the reference'),dict(year='2002',event='藍溪案例另一縱斷面調查年代~Date of another Blue Creek profile used for morphological comparison'),dict(year='2007',event='NRCS 固床方法技術補編出版~Publication of the NRCS technical supplement on grade stabilization')],['NRCS NEH 654 TS14G 固床技術補編，非場址設計核准~NRCS NEH 654 TS14G grade stabilization methods, not site design approval','NRCS 410 國家標準目錄與地方適用文件~NRCS 410 national standard directory and locally applicable documents','HEC 泥砂起動臨界值方法說明~HEC methodological reference on sediment motion thresholds'],['伊利諾州藍溪案例~Blue Creek Illinois reference','曼尼托巴省明克溪案例~Mink Creek Manitoba reference'],dict(name='伊利諾州固床案例參照區~Illinois grade control reference region',country='美國~United States',lat=40.0,lng=-89.0,query='Blue Creek Illinois NRCS grade stabilization'),['nrcs-grade','nrcs-grade-standard','hec-shields'])
project('b278','依魚種生命期解析通道水理、入口誘導與通過證據~Relating passage hydraulics and attraction to species, life stage and passage evidence','從水池落差、孔口流量與能量密度開始，接續游泳能力、入口誘導、休息區與篩網比較。課程不提供通用魚類流速標準，而要求把魚種、體長、季節和水溫寫入設計條件，並透過偵測率及多段通過率分析，區分水理可行性與真正的遷移成果。~Start with pool drops, opening discharge and energy density, then examine swimming ability, attraction, resting areas and screening. No universal fish velocity limit is supplied. Species, body size, season and temperature belong in the design conditions. Detection efficiency and passage through multiple reaches distinguish a hydraulically plausible facility from demonstrated migration outcomes.','NOAA 鮭科魚類通道手冊的官方目錄於二〇二三年刊載，附錄涵蓋水理評估及水池尺度。教材只使用已讀目錄範圍，未宣稱全文審查。二〇〇九年墾務局篩網評估指南提供另一類設施的量測比較。麥克納利水壩二〇一四年七鰓鰻原型通道則提醒不同魚種不能共用同一種通行假設。案例名稱與公開年代不會被當成假想試算的實測資料。~NOAA posted its salmonid passage manual directory in 2023, with appendices addressing hydraulic evaluation and pool dimensions. Only the reviewed directory scope is used here, without claiming a full manual review. The 2009 Reclamation screening evaluation guide supports comparison with a different facility type. A McNary lamprey prototype installed in 2014 illustrates why species need different passage assumptions. Named cases and public dates do not turn the independently chosen exercise inputs into field measurements.',['墾務局魚類篩網現地評估指南出版於 2009 年~Reclamation published its fish screening field evaluation guide in 2009','麥克納利七鰓鰻通道原型於 2014 年安裝~The McNary lamprey passage prototype was installed in 2014'],[dict(year='2009',event='魚類篩網水理現地評估指南出版~Publication of the hydraulic field evaluation guide for fish screening'),dict(year='2014',event='麥克納利俄勒岡岸魚道裝設七鰓鰻通道原型~A lamprey passage prototype is installed in the Oregon shore McNary ladder'),dict(year='2023',event='NOAA 官方刊載鮭科魚類通道手冊目錄~NOAA posts the official salmonid passage manual directory')],['NOAA 鮭科魚類通道手冊目錄，限定已讀附錄主題~NOAA salmonid passage manual directory, limited to reviewed appendix topics','USBR 魚類篩網水理評估指南，與上溯魚道分別適用~USBR fish screening hydraulic evaluation guide, applied separately from upstream passage'],['麥克納利七鰓鰻通道~McNary lamprey passage reference','邦納維爾魚道計數站~Bonneville fish counting reference'],dict(name='麥克納利水壩區域參照點~McNary Dam regional reference',country='美國~United States',lat=45.935,lng=-119.299,query='McNary Dam fish ladder'),['noaa-passage','usbr-fish-evaluation','mcnary-lamprey','usace-fish-counts'])
project('b279','以地形、水文與泥砂連通性檢驗河川再蜿蜒~Testing river remeandering through geometry, hydrology and sediment connectivity','再蜿蜒不只是把直線河道畫成曲線，而是重新安排河道長度、洪氾空間、地下水交換與泥砂的移動途徑。十個單元由地形量測走向流況及監測設計，並要求比較工程前後及參照區，避免把自然年際變化誤認為復育工程的單一成果。~Remeandering reorganizes channel length, floodplain space, groundwater exchange and sediment pathways. Ten units move from geometric measurement to flow processes and monitoring design. Comparisons across time and reference reaches help separate restoration signals from natural variation. Learners examine both the intended ecological gains and the hydraulic consequences of reconnecting a river with surrounding land.','歐洲環境署對斯凱恩河的資料指出，一九六八年河道整治後，於一九九九至二〇〇三年間進行復育；其一九九二與二〇一八年正射影像是比較資料，而不是施工起訖。雷赫河則於一九九八年啟動流域復育計畫。兩地提供不同治理尺度的參照，本課不把舊資料中的預定完成日期改寫成已完成事實，也不以歐洲案例替代其他氣候地區的場址調查。~The EEA account of the Skjern records channelization in 1968 and restoration during 1999 to 2003. Its 1992 and 2018 orthophotos are comparison evidence, not construction dates. The Regge programme began in 1998 and provides another scale of restoration governance. An old anticipated completion date is not restated as an achieved milestone. Neither European example replaces site investigations in other climates; the calculations explore independently specified channel and floodplain scenarios.',['斯凱恩河復育期間為 1999–2003 年，依 EEA 案例圖資~Skjern restoration occurred during 1999–2003 according to the EEA case evidence','斯凱恩比較影像為 1992 與 2018 年，不是工程起訖~Skjern comparison imagery dates are 1992 and 2018, not construction endpoints'],[dict(year='1968',event='斯凱恩案例所述河道整治年代~Date of Skjern channelization identified by the case evidence'),dict(year='1998',event='雷赫河復育計畫啟動，屬另一流域案例~The Regge programme begins in a separate river basin'),dict(year='1999–2003',event='斯凱恩河案例所述復育施工期間~Restoration period identified in the Skjern River case evidence')],['NRCS NEH 654 河川復育方法補編，需檢查跨區適用性~NRCS NEH 654 restoration methods, requiring regional applicability checks','EEA 河川復育案例與影像解讀範圍~EEA river restoration cases and the limits of imagery interpretation'],['丹麥斯凱恩河復育~Skjern River Denmark restoration','荷蘭雷赫河復育~Regge River Netherlands restoration'],dict(name='斯凱恩河復育區參照點~Skjern restoration regional reference',country='丹麥~Denmark',lat=55.94,lng=8.39,query='Skjern River restoration Denmark'),['eea-skjern','nrcs-bio','eea-regge'])
project('b280','以集合預報、守恆與限制條件協調多水庫防洪~Coordinating reservoir flood operations using ensembles, conservation and constraints','將預報誤差、河道傳播時間、庫容與下游通洪能力放在同一個運算框架，練習集合機率、校準、預洩與衝突限制辨識。教材以兩座假想水庫展示聯合操作所需的狀態和責任邊界，計算結果只作方法教學，實際操作仍需正式規程與有權機關決策。~Place forecast uncertainty, routing time, storage and downstream capacity in one calculation framework. Exercises cover ensemble probabilities, calibration, prerelease and conflicting constraints. Two hypothetical reservoirs illustrate the states and responsibilities required for coordinated operation. Results teach methods rather than authorize releases; real decisions require approved operating rules, current observations and the responsible institutions.','俄羅斯河預報知情操作研究自二〇一四年起發展，公開案例包括門多西諾湖與索諾瑪湖。另一地區的美國氣象局中大西洋河川預報中心於二〇一七年底開始試行集合水文產品，不能把兩者寫成同一計畫。HEC 水庫網路手冊提供水庫、河段、節點與出口的概念分類。本課引用這些不同來源建立方法脈絡，並以原創集合與庫容數字檢查預報如何進入可追溯的操作比較。~Russian River forecast informed operations research has developed since 2014, with Lake Mendocino and Lake Sonoma as named cases. In another region, the Mid Atlantic River Forecast Center began experimental ensemble products in late 2017. These are distinct programmes. The HEC reservoir network manual distinguishes reservoirs, reaches, junctions and outlets. Together the references establish methodological context, while original ensemble and storage numbers demonstrate how forecasts enter traceable comparisons of operating alternatives.',['俄羅斯河 FIRO 研究自 2014 年起發展與測試~Russian River FIRO research has developed and tested methods since 2014','MARFC 於 2017 年底開始試行集合預報，屬不同地區服務~MARFC began experimental ensemble products in late 2017 in a different region'],[dict(year='2014',event='俄羅斯河預報知情操作研究開始發展~Development begins on Russian River forecast informed reservoir operations'),dict(year='2017',event='MARFC 開始試行集合水文預報產品~MARFC begins experimental hydrologic ensemble forecast products')],['HEC ResSim 水庫網路官方使用手冊~HEC ResSim official reservoir network user documentation','NWS HEFS 集合水文預報方法官方說明~NWS HEFS official explanation of hydrologic ensemble methods'],['門多西諾湖預報研究~Lake Mendocino forecasting reference','索諾瑪湖預報研究~Lake Sonoma forecasting reference'],dict(name='門多西諾湖區域參照點~Lake Mendocino regional reference',country='美國~United States',lat=39.20,lng=-123.18,query='Lake Mendocino FIRO'),['hec-network','nws-hefs','cw3e-firo'])
